### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/ping

### List all instruments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/instruments

### Get one instrument
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/instruments/TCS

### Unknown instrument - expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/instruments/FAKE

### Place a buy order - expect 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "symbol": "TCS",
  "side": "BUY",
  "quantity": 10
}

### Insufficient funds - expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "symbol": "TCS",
  "side": "BUY",
  "quantity": 100000
}

